(a) Protection of civilians, through proactive, robust, and dynamic patrolling, active deterrence, and rapid deployment to areas under threat, paying specific attention to the protection of women and children, including the prevention of and response to conflict-related sexual violence and grave violations against children, and integrating a gender-responsive approach;
