(c) Support for the preparation and holding of peaceful, transparent, inclusive, and credible elections, including by providing technical, logistical, and operational assistance, as well as coordinated security support, and calls upon international partners to provide adequate, predictable, and timely financial, logistical, and technical support to the CAR authorities, the National Elections Authority, and the electoral basket fund;
